      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAST TRACK (1) consistent mare resuming after making good progress last time in. Came to the end of her preparation with a tough on-pace third over 1550m at Canterbury at her most recent appearance on February 13. Primed with the two trials and gets in light with Le Roux's 3kg claim. Will park on the speed and prove hard to get past. IMPERIAL ROYALE (5) got the Maiden win out of the way at start two at Nowra, then jumped in class with a respectable third over 1200m at Newcastle. Trip suits in a very average contest. BRIGHT PROMISE (4) has gone to a new level this prep with the two wins from her three starts. Covered plenty of ground in the run with a tiring fourth over 1450m at Illawarra Grange. Awkwardly drawn again and stays in the calculations. AHELLBENDA (2)  resumes from a lengthy break and the blinkers come off. Trialled only fairly but worth noting the two wins came over this trip. Can take a hand in the finish.",
